{
  "title": "Dreamscape Odyssey: Blooming Reverie",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Dreamscape Odyssey: Blooming Reverie</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Quests\">Main</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Event</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Somnium_Labyrinth\" title=\"Somnium Labyrinth\">Somnium Labyrinth</a><br /><b>Chapter</b><br /><a href=\"/wiki/When_the_Night_Knocks\" title=\"When the Night Knocks\">When the Night Knocks</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dreamscape_Odyssey:_A_Study_in_Snow\" title=\"Dreamscape Odyssey: A Study in Snow\">Dreamscape Odyssey: A Study in Snow</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/When_the_Night_Knocks\" title=\"When the Night Knocks\">When the Night Knocks</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Camellya\" title=\"Camellya\">Camellya</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Enter the gateway</li>\n<li>Move forward</li>\n<li>Approach Rover</li>\n<li>Eliminate the enemies standing in your way</li>\n<li>Approach Rover</li>\n<li>Eliminate the enemies standing in your way</li>\n<li>Talk to the strange white cat</li>\n<li>Continue looking for Rover</li>\n<li>Go find Rover</li>\n<li>Eliminate the enemies standing in your way</li>\n<li>Go find Rover</li>\n<li>Eliminate the enemies standing in your way</li>\n<li>Go find Rover</li>\n<li>Eliminate the enemies standing in your way</li>\n<li>Look for Rover</li>\n<li>Eliminate the enemies standing in your way</li>\n<li>Look for Rover</li>\n<li>Defeat the enemy</li>\n<li>Rescue Camellya</li>\n<li>Save Camellya again</li>\n<li>Save Camellya. No matter how many times it takes!</li>\n<li>Eliminate the nightmares surrounding Camellya</li>\n<li>Rescue Camellya</li>\n<li>(Optional) Talk to Camellya</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Enter the gateway)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d6/Vo_wtnkeq_88_1.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213135\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_88_1.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_88_1.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Is this real or just another dream?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/a4/Vo_wtnkeq_88_2.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213136\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_88_2.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_88_2.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Hehe... If it's a dream, it better be juicy!</dd>\n<dt>(Camera points at Rover from a distance)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d2/Vo_wtnkeq_89_1_M.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213138\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_89_1_M.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_89_1_M.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ad/Vo_wtnkeq_89_1_F.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213137\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_89_1_F.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_89_1_F.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Huh... <span>(&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"He\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">He</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for male Rover</span></span>&#8205;/<wbr />&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"She\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">She</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for female Rover</span></span>&#8205;&#8205;)</span>'s here too?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/c/c6/Vo_wtnkeq_89_2.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213139\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_89_2.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_89_2.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Wait for me to catch you, Rover.</dd>\n<dt>(Approach Rover)</dt>\n<dt>(Defeat the monsters)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/fb/Vo_wtnkeq_90_1.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213140\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_90_1.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_90_1.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Oh, you wanna play hide and seek?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/bf/Vo_wtnkeq_90_2.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213141\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_90_2.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_90_2.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> The tastiest meals is always the one you've worked hardest to catch.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Enter the gateway)</dt>\n<dt>(Camera points at Rover from a distance)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5c/Vo_wtnkeq_91_1.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213142\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_91_1.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_91_1.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> There you are.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f3/Vo_wtnkeq_91_2.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213143\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_91_2.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_91_2.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Quit the running and come play with me. Let's not waste our precious time.</dd>\n<dt>(Defeat the monsters)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/a8/Vo_wtnkeq_92_1.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213144\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_92_1.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_92_1.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Ugh, what a bother...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/07/Vo_wtnkeq_92_2.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213145\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_92_2.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_92_2.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Why does the Black Shores keep dumping these dull missions on me?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/9/9e/Vo_wtnkeq_92_3.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213146\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_92_3.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_92_3.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> ...This doesn't satisfy me at all!</dd>\n<dt>(Defeat the monsters)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/78/Vo_wtnkeq_93_1_M.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213148\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_93_1_M.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_93_1_M.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e0/Vo_wtnkeq_93_1_F.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213147\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_93_1_F.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_93_1_F.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> ...Hello? <span>(&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"He\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">He</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for male Rover</span></span>&#8205;/<wbr />&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"She\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">She</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for female Rover</span></span>&#8205;&#8205;)</span> disappeared again!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/a8/Vo_wtnkeq_93_2.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213149\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_93_2.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_93_2.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Boring, boring, boring...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/12/Vo_wtnkeq_93_3.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213150\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_93_3.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_93_3.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> ...I hate boring!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Vo_wtnkeq_94_1.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213151\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_94_1.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_94_1.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> I live for a good thrill.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/4f/Vo_wtnkeq_94_2.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213152\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_94_2.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_94_2.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> But it's so hard to find one that meets my standards.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/ec/Vo_wtnkeq_94_3.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213153\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_94_3.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_94_3.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Some have potential, but they're still too dull.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/54/Vo_wtnkeq_94_4.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213154\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_94_4.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_94_4.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Only you can really get me heart racing, Rover.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Fight with Rover)</dt>\n<dt>(You swing your final strike at the struggling enemy, but your blade cuts through nothing but air.)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/2/26/Vo_wtnkeq_96_1.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213155\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_96_1.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_96_1.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> You?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/12/Vo_wtnkeq_96_2.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213156\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_96_2.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_96_2.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> No... Impossible.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/76/Vo_wtnkeq_96_3.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213157\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_96_3.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_96_3.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> I remember the way you fought your—blade's strong enough to sever the air itself.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/fd/Vo_wtnkeq_96_4.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213158\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_96_4.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_96_4.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Powerful, beautiful, intoxicating...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/ff/Vo_wtnkeq_96_5.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213159\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_96_5.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_96_5.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Ah... My head... It hurts. No, that's not you!</dd>\n<dt>(Camellya gets surrounded by TDs)</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Save Camellya)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Vo_wtnkeq_97_1_M.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213201\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_97_1_M.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_97_1_M.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/af/Vo_wtnkeq_97_1_F.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213200\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_97_1_F.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_97_1_F.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Rover:</b> Is that... Camellya? She needs help.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/83/Vo_wtnkeq_97_2_M.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213203\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_97_2_M.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_97_2_M.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b6/Vo_wtnkeq_97_2_F.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213202\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_97_2_F.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_97_2_F.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Rover:</b> I need to go to her, quick.</dd>\n<dt>(Camellya is in danger!)</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(The nightmares have devoured Camellya. You are back at the starting point...)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/a3/Vo_wtnkeq_98_1_M.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213205\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_98_1_M.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_98_1_M.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d3/Vo_wtnkeq_98_1_F.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213204\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_98_1_F.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_98_1_F.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Rover:</b> Too slow...</dd>\n<dt>(Camellya is in danger!)</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(The nightmares have devoured Camellya. You are back at the starting point...)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/00/Vo_wtnkeq_98_2_M.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213207\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_98_2_M.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_98_2_M.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/be/Vo_wtnkeq_98_2_F.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213206\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_98_2_F.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_98_2_F.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Rover:</b> Gotta be faster...</dd>\n<dt>(Fight with Camellya</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/84/Vo_wtnkeq_99_1.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213208\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_1.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_1.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> It's... you...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Yes.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> I'm here for you, Camellya.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d6/Vo_wtnkeq_99_4.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213209\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_4.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_4.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> ...Hehe, I knew I was right.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/a2/Vo_wtnkeq_99_5.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213210\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_5.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_5.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> That thing couldn't be you. You always... exceed my expectations.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> I'm right here.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I wont die that easily.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/4b/Vo_wtnkeq_99_8.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213211\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_8.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_8.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> ...I know. After all, you're the one I've chosen, my beloved seed.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Vo_wtnkeq_99_9.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213212\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_9.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_9.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> While I crave your sweet words, a part of me craves the thrill of hunting you down.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> We can do this after we get out.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I'll make time for you.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"audio-button\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f6/Vo_wtnkeq_99_12.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20241120213213\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_12.ogg\">https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/File:Vo_wtnkeq_99_12.ogg</a></audio></span></span>   <b>Camellya:</b> Oh, is that an invitation? You do know how to please me.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Leave the Somnoire)</dt>\n<dt>(Quest returns to <a href=\"/wiki/When_the_Night_Knocks\" title=\"When the Night Knocks\">When the Night Knocks</a>)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>La